<p>Fires a bolt of blight, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">121, 163, 195, 223, 247</acronym> blight damage and replenishing 20% of it as vim energy.</p><p>The amount of vim regained depends on the target's rank (higher ranks give more vim).</p><p>The effect will increase with your Spellpower.</p>